Executive Summary  

On Sept 30 2025 the security monitoring system identified a file named `RAT.txt` containing the hash of a known Remote Access Trojan (RAT) trojan on the Ubuntu and Windows 10 VM. The detection was facilitated through Wazuh's integration with VirusTotal, which flagged the file as malicious. The presence of this file suggests a compromise or attempt to introduce malicious software into the environment, warranting immediate investigation and response to mitigate potential damage.
