- Detection Details:  
  The Wazuh agent detected `RAT.txt` in the `/root` directory of the Ubuntu VM and the Downloads folder of the Windows 10 VM. The file contained a hash value matching a known RAT trojan cataloged in VirusTotal’s database.  
